512x512
A stylized 4x4 grid representing the 2048 game. The grid is centered on a light gray background. Each tile is a square with a light gray border and a slightly darker gray background. The tiles display numbers 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, 1024, and 2048 in varying shades of blue, green, orange, and red. The largest tile (2048) is highlighted with a bright orange background and bold white text. The overall composition is clean, modern, and suitable as a logo for a mini app.
